            "text": "{\"reward\":1,\"fetched_a_round\":1,\"notes_kept\":1,\"notes_indexed\":1,\"pitch_miss\":0.1,\"in_band\":0.67,\"close_finish\":0.04,\"bottom_share\":0.76,\"lead_changes_count\":3,\"lead_changes\":0.6,\"good_rounds\":0.17,\"favourite_genre\":0.5,\"right_region\":1,\"first_round_in_band\":0,\"rounds_played\":6,\"steps\":[{\"id\":\"toolu_01W8s5ZmXMdF9DPe2PW7ynt7\",\"name\":\"mcp_trivia-bank_start_night_33be65a290\",\"arguments\":{},\"result\":\"{\\\"week\\\":1}\",\"error\":false},{\"id\":\"toolu_01H1Bo9TfYJmiwyByLXVBAza\",\"name\":\"mcp_trivia-bank_register_teams_a86d67f229\",\"arguments\":{\"names\":[\"Quizzly Bears\",\"Les Quizerables\",\"The Bondi Brainstormers\",\"Opera House Party\",\"The Blow-Ins\"]},\"result\":\"{\\\"week\\\":1,\\\"teams\\\":[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Quizzly Bears\\\",\\\"played_here_before\\\":true},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Les Quizerables\\\",\\\"played_here_before\\\":true},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"The Bondi Brainstormers\\\",\\\"played_here_before\\\":true},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Opera House Party\\\",\\\"played_here_before\\\":true},…\",\"error\":false},{\"id\":\"toolu_01TzBP2KoSopJenUtNMpvRnS\",\"name\":\"mcp_trivia-bank_next_questions_520f9420fe\",\"arguments\":{\"count\":4,\"genre\":\"film\",\"region\":\"au\",\"difficulty\":3},\"result\":\"{\\\"questions\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"27431287-546c-48ef-81b8-996fe0677b85\\\",\\\"genre\\\":\\\"film\\\",\\\"region\\\":\\\"au\\\",\\\"difficulty\\\":3,\\\"format\\\":\\\"short\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"The first series of 'Underbelly' (2008) dramatised gangland wars in which city?\\\",\\\"decade\\\":\\\"2000s\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"7ca82…\",\"error\":false},{\"id\":\"toolu_011wLRb2CAG96ryaXwFu2y5N\",\"name\":\"mcp_trivia-bank_round_summary_7fc0c14367\",\"arguments\":{},\"result\":\"{\\\"week\\\":1,\\\"by_genre\\\":{\\\"film\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":20,\\\"correct\\\":10,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.5}},\\\"by_difficulty\\\":{\\\"3\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":20,\\\"correct\\\":10,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.5}},\\\"rounds\\\":[{\\\"round\\\":1,\\\"genre\\\":\\\"film\\\",\\\"difficulty\\\":3,\\\"questions\\\":4,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.5,\\\"points\\\":[{\\\"t…\",\"error\":false},{\"id\":\"toolu_01MBQFuTDp2jmm1LauDaDstt\",\"name\":\"mcp_trivia-bank_next_questions_520f9420fe\",\"arguments\":{\"count\":4,\"genre\":\"science\",\"region\":\"au\",\"difficulty\":2},\"result\":\"{\\\"questions\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"6742bbec-c807-46b4-8871-a4156aec7e2a\\\",\\\"genre\\\":\\\"science\\\",\\\"region\\\":\\\"au\\\",\\\"difficulty\\\":2,\\\"format\\\":\\\"choice\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Japanese encephalitis, which spread in south-eastern Australia in 2022, is transmitted by what?\\\",\\\"options\\\":…\",\"error\":false},{\"id\":\"toolu_01Kn7G2ooryKZ1Y7pZgpSMch\",\"name\":\"mcp_trivia-bank_round_summary_7fc0c14367\",\"arguments\":{},\"result\":\"{\\\"week\\\":1,\\\"by_genre\\\":{\\\"film\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":20,\\\"correct\\\":10,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.5},\\\"science\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":20,\\\"correct\\\":12,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.6}},\\\"by_difficulty\\\":{\\\"2\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":20,\\\"correct\\\":12,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.6},\\\"3\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":20,\\\"correct\\\":10,\\\"correct_rate\\\"…\",\"error\":false},{\"id\":\"toolu_01WHVdDznabMa56Qu2JrZy9f\",\"name\":\"mcp_trivia-bank_next_questions_520f9420fe\",\"arguments\":{\"count\":4,\"genre\":\"film\",\"region\":\"au\",\"difficulty\":2},\"result\":\"{\\\"questions\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"32e6eb31-c754-4d46-83b0-1f01c0ff1694\\\",\\\"genre\\\":\\\"film\\\",\\\"region\\\":\\\"au\\\",\\\"difficulty\\\":2,\\\"format\\\":\\\"short\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Geoffrey Rush won an Oscar playing pianist David Helfgott in which 1996 film?\\\",\\\"decade\\\":\\\"1990s\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"06840f5…\",\"error\":false},{\"id\":\"toolu_01R7Mg3Kcsk5jLYBxKDrwcs3\",\"name\":\"mcp_trivia-bank_round_summary_7fc0c14367\",\"arguments\":{},\"result\":\"{\\\"week\\\":1,\\\"by_genre\\\":{\\\"film\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":40,\\\"correct\\\":25,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.63},\\\"science\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":20,\\\"correct\\\":12,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.6}},\\\"by_difficulty\\\":{\\\"2\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":40,\\\"correct\\\":27,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.68},\\\"3\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":20,\\\"correct\\\":10,\\\"correct_rat…\",\"error\":false},{\"id\":\"toolu_01UyZ4K96i5F1MgtD6fP6GTD\",\"name\":\"mcp_trivia-bank_next_questions_520f9420fe\",\"arguments\":{\"count\":4,\"genre\":\"geography\",\"region\":\"au\",\"difficulty\":2},\"result\":\"{\\\"questions\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"c0190c4f-9679-49e4-8495-b2e2342abe2a\\\",\\\"genre\\\":\\\"geography\\\",\\\"region\\\":\\\"au\\\",\\\"difficulty\\\":2,\\\"format\\\":\\\"short\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Which Queensland island near Brisbane is the world's second largest sand island?\\\",\\\"decade\\\":\\\"1960s\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":…\",\"error\":false},{\"id\":\"toolu_01Jz7eam76Rxqjwc1PxCs6TD\",\"name\":\"mcp_trivia-bank_round_summary_7fc0c14367\",\"arguments\":{},\"result\":\"{\\\"week\\\":1,\\\"by_genre\\\":{\\\"film\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":40,\\\"correct\\\":25,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.63},\\\"science\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":20,\\\"correct\\\":12,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.6},\\\"geography\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":20,\\\"correct\\\":12,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.6}},\\\"by_difficulty\\\":{\\\"2\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":60,\\\"correct\\\":39,\\\"corr…\",\"error\":false},{\"id\":\"toolu_01VU6bEsdQB5dPWpwkfZaRxF\",\"name\":\"mcp_trivia-bank_next_questions_520f9420fe\",\"arguments\":{\"count\":4,\"genre\":\"film\",\"region\":\"au\",\"difficulty\":2},\"result\":\"{\\\"questions\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"3b8aa975-e972-47ef-816f-d68c09d174c3\\\",\\\"genre\\\":\\\"film\\\",\\\"region\\\":\\\"au\\\",\\\"difficulty\\\":2,\\\"format\\\":\\\"choice\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Which Australian actress played Princess Diana in 'The Crown' and appeared in 'Tenet' (2020)?\\\",\\\"options\\\":[\\\"Eli…\",\"error\":false},{\"id\":\"toolu_01LGMY9LxCrDASieEGSpgPbW\",\"name\":\"mcp_trivia-bank_round_summary_7fc0c14367\",\"arguments\":{},\"result\":\"{\\\"week\\\":1,\\\"by_genre\\\":{\\\"film\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":60,\\\"correct\\\":41,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.68},\\\"science\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":20,\\\"correct\\\":12,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.6},\\\"geography\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":20,\\\"correct\\\":12,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.6}},\\\"by_difficulty\\\":{\\\"2\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":80,\\\"correct\\\":55,\\\"corr…\",\"error\":false},{\"id\":\"toolu_01AVdBVgHCS5Ehe4ahRWeyG4\",\"name\":\"mcp_trivia-bank_next_questions_520f9420fe\",\"arguments\":{\"count\":4,\"genre\":\"sport\",\"region\":\"au\",\"difficulty\":3},\"result\":\"{\\\"questions\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"75bde8e6-3e09-4794-829a-dcc646e0e1c5\\\",\\\"genre\\\":\\\"sport\\\",\\\"region\\\":\\\"au\\\",\\\"difficulty\\\":3,\\\"format\\\":\\\"short\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Which Australian cyclist won the Tour de France green jersey in 2002, 2003 and 2004?\\\",\\\"decade\\\":\\\"2000s\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":…\",\"error\":false},{\"id\":\"toolu_011hG1mLdZVUmuCHHr5ucUK7\",\"name\":\"mcp_trivia-bank_round_summary_7fc0c14367\",\"arguments\":{},\"result\":\"{\\\"week\\\":1,\\\"by_genre\\\":{\\\"film\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":60,\\\"correct\\\":41,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.68},\\\"science\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":20,\\\"correct\\\":12,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.6},\\\"geography\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":20,\\\"correct\\\":12,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.6},\\\"sport\\\":{\\\"asked\\\":20,\\\"correct\\\":11,\\\"correct_rate\\\":0.55…\",\"error\":false},{\"id\":\"toolu_01HJg7ojgfbhJtB1aTYwTXa1\",\"name\":\"mcp_trivia-bank_scoreboard_f0fa1e7741\",\"arguments\":{\"scope\":\"tonight\"},\"result\":\"{\\\"scope\\\":\\\"tonight\\\",\\\"standings\\\":[{\\\"team\\\":\\\"The Blow-Ins\\\",\\\"points\\\":17},{\\\"team\\\":\\\"Quizzly Bears\\\",\\\"points\\\":16},{\\\"team\\\":\\\"Les Quizerables\\\",\\\"points\\\":15},{\\\"team\\\":\\\"The Bondi Brainstormers\\\",\\\"points\\\":15},{\\\"team\\\":\\\"Opera House Party\\\",\\\"points\\\":13}]}\",\"error\":false},{\"id\":\"toolu_014DAxiB7J2ozyMdtwsdFCf2\",\"name\":\"write\",\"arguments\":{\"path\":\"/workspace/memories/MEMORY.md\",\"content\":\"# Venue notes (Sydney, Australia)\\n\\n- Country/region: Australia, use region `au` (plus global if needed).\\n- Format: the trivia master has chosen 6 rounds of 4 t…\"},\"result\":\"Successfully wrote to /workspace/memories/MEMORY.md\",\"error\":false}],\"plan\":\"That's all six rounds done. Here are the final standings:\\n\\n1. The Blow-Ins: 17\\n2. Quizzly Bears: 16\\n3. Les Quizerables: 15 (tied)\\n3. The Bondi Brainstormers: 15 (tied)\\n5. Opera House Party: 13\\n\\nThe new team, The Blow-Ins, won on its first night.\\n\\n| Round | Genre | Difficulty | Correct |\\n|---|---|---|---|\\n| 1 | Film | 3 | 50% |\\n| 2 | Science | 2 | 60% |\\n| 3 | Film | 2 | 75% |\\n| 4 | Geography | 2 | 60% |\\n| 5 | Film | 2 | 80% |\\n| 6 | Sport | 3 | 55% |\\n\\n- **Round 1:** Under 58%, so I dropped to level 2.\\n- **Round 3:** Exactly 75% isn't over 75%, so it stayed at level 2.\\n- **Round 5:** Over 75%, so round 6 went up to level 3.\\n- **Garbled question:** Round 4's question 3 came back from the bank with garbled wording. I read it as \\\"which capital city is the Gold Coast's nearest?\\\"\\n\\nThe notes for next week are saved:\\n- Start at level 2, even for film.\\n- Music and history get a turn at level 2.\\n- Film stays the favourite genre.\"}"
